# Installed by the update tool and checked with visudo first. {{admin_user}} may run these READ-ONLY commands as {{worker_user}} without a
# password. Everything else (approve, cancel, kill, unlock, installing an update) still asks for the password. Each line names the exact
# command and subcommand; none of them can change the worker's state.
Cmnd_Alias {{alias}} = {{commands}}
{{admin_user}} ALL=({{worker_user}}) NOPASSWD: {{alias}}
